<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_lpUSgi2JtEuX9JSkeHqsyw_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Park PA). In each case, Lincoln Park&#8217;s maximum commitment in any single Regular Purchase may not exceed $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DAPMTJHf20qZkzEfEXABBQ" contextRef="Duration_10_11_2024_To_10_11_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_H81ebL9d7keBsNh9OohdfQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:MaximumFinancingFromCommonStock" scale="0" id="Narr_TOoKdbt1qUmLqg6oF-HLKA">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction>. The purchase price per share for each such Regular Purchase will be based on an agreed-upon fixed discount to the prevailing market prices of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock immediately preceding the time of sale. In addition to Regular Purchases, the Company may also direct Lincoln Park to purchase other amounts as accelerated purchases or as additional accelerated purchases at such times and subject to the limitations set forth in the 2024 Lincoln Park PA.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">Under applicable rules&#160;of the NYSE American, in no event could the Company issue or sell to Lincoln Park under the 2024 Lincoln Park PA any shares of its Common Stock to the extent the issuance of such shares of Common Stock, when aggregated with all other shares of Common Stock issued pursuant to the 2024 Lincoln Park PA, would cause the aggregate number of shares of Common Stock issued pursuant to the 2024 Lincoln Park PA to exceed <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_gq9gxZAp4U2-ijGPtUR6uw" contextRef="Duration_10_11_2024_To_10_11_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_H81ebL9d7keBsNh9OohdfQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:ExchangeShareCapRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_g4HNTIUV6kerICPue2e8BQ">19.99</ix:nonFraction>% of the shares of Common Stock outstanding immediately prior to the execution of the 2024 Lincoln Park PA without stockholder approval. &#160;On May 27, 2025, the Company held its 2025 Annual Stockholders Meeting and obtained stockholder approval for the issuance of more than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_gq9gxZAp4U2-ijGPtUR6uw" contextRef="Duration_5_27_2025_To_5_27_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_V3scLkLyiUyK1hqbvnynVQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:ThresholdHoldingPercentageMandatingStockholderApprovalForIssuanceOfShares" scale="-2" id="Narr_qtktRU5oj0C4GLxQFztDCw">19.99</ix:nonFraction>% of the shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock outstanding.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Lincoln Park has no right to require the Company to sell any shares of Common Stock to Lincoln Park, but Lincoln Park is obligated to make purchases as the Company directs, subject to certain conditions. In all instances, the Company may not sell shares of its Common Stock to Lincoln Park under the 2024 Lincoln Park PA if it would result in Lincoln Park beneficially owning more than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_gq9gxZAp4U2-ijGPtUR6uw" contextRef="Duration_10_11_2024_To_10_11_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_H81ebL9d7keBsNh9OohdfQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:ContractConditionsOwnershipLimitPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_vF_nd3qE40Khd400TbTaKw">9.99</ix:nonFraction>% of its Common Stock. There are no upper limits on the price per share that Lincoln Park must pay for shares of Common Stock.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">As consideration for its commitment to purchase shares of Common Stock under the 2024 Lincoln Park PA, the Company issued to Lincoln Park <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_J-g7dEaKxk-gRn7X2bISag" contextRef="As_Of_10_11_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_WeO_G0iAR0eEXQnWJZSpFg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:ConsiderationForCommitmentToPurchaseCommonStock" scale="0" id="Narr_NXBUp20H_Ee3znKHtyo1Dw">600,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock and may issue to Lincoln Park up to an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_J-g7dEaKxk-gRn7X2bISag" contextRef="As_Of_10_11_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_WeO_G0iAR0eEXQnWJZSpFg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:AdditionalConsiderationForCommitmentToPurchaseCommonStock" scale="0" id="Narr_D4_d1P8rI0iVv8zLjtyqPg">600,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock (the &#8220;Additional Commitment Shares&#8221;) in connection with each purchase of Common Stock by Lincoln Park and in an amount of Additional Commitment Shares as calculated pursuant to the 2024 Lincoln Park PA.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Actual sales of shares of Common Stock to Lincoln Park will depend on a variety of factors to be determined by the Company from time to time, including, among others, market conditions, the trading price of the Common Stock and determinations by the Company as to the appropriate sources of funding for the Company and its operations. &#160;Lincoln Park has covenanted not to cause or engage in, in any manner whatsoever, any direct or indirect short selling or hedging of the Company&#8217;s shares of Common Stock.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The net proceeds under the 2024 Lincoln Park PA to the Company will depend on the frequency and prices at which the Company sells shares of its Common Stock to Lincoln Park. &#160;The Company expects that any proceeds received by the Company from such sales to Lincoln Park will be used for working capital and general corporate purposes.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_J-g7dEaKxk-gRn7X2bISag" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_NCegkg8DU0KD05MCVWGOuA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_bHJnU9N88k-N4-Rl-b2JJQ">no</ix:nonFraction> sales of Common Stock pursuant to the 2024 Lincoln Park PA for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">During the three and six months ended June 30, 2025, the Company sold approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_J-g7dEaKxk-gRn7X2bISag" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_5HUXJReOtEiOyJge7Qqm5w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="6" id="Narr_QqJ3ARkq_0yV2T7AfUxq0A">1.3</ix:nonFraction> million and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_J-g7dEaKxk-gRn7X2bISag" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_K_ZHCgklf028M-4tV-A0vA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="6" id="Narr_Y9nQf2K-CEuFc49alHMbsw">5.1</ix:nonFraction> million shares of Common Stock for net proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DAPMTJHf20qZkzEfEXABBQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_5HUXJReOtEiOyJge7Qqm5w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="6" id="Narr_k3FfiqGM3kqvNhTtVrCvgQ">0.6</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DAPMTJHf20qZkzEfEXABBQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_K_ZHCgklf028M-4tV-A0vA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="6" id="Narr_l5wcJnTzyEOgfbRrbQDvcg">3.22</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, pursuant to the 2024 Lincoln Park PA. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">As of June 30, 2026, the Company has approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DAPMTJHf20qZkzEfEXABBQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_wwr_AtmOfferingAgreementAndStockPurchaseAgreementMember_cGHd5uuu3Uyruim-F0mSZA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:SharesAvailableForFutureIssuanceValue" scale="6" id="Narr_yP8Ivb41TEa0p5pG_rUdmQ">26.2</ix:nonFraction> million worth of shares of Common Stock that are available for future sales, subject to the limitations noted above, pursuant to the 2024 Lincoln Park PA, which expires in October 2026. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_AnXtsi3ryE2csYyK9gn6Rg" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCost