gRn7X2bISag" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_wwr_TwoThousandThirteenOmnibusIncentivePlanMember_521dDJlJLUuVXfkM7Uod_g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_l9p6ito8mk6AMpEdiVPRfA">730,057</ix:nonFraction> shares were available for future issuances under the 2013 Plan. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The Inducement Plan provides for the grant of equity-based awards, including RSUs, restricted stock, performance shares and performance units. Under the Inducement Plan, the Company may grant equity awards for the sole purpose of recruiting and hiring new employees. The Board approved an amendment to the Inducement Plan to increase the authorized number of shares of Common Stock available and reserved for issuance under the Inducement Plan by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_J-g7dEaKxk-gRn7X2bISag" contextRef="Duration_5_22_2026_To_5_22_2026_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_wwr_InducementPlanMember_dVjjTXnKHE6MAwwAR0_QsQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_Euok8yK-T0mT1tZj1xlsAg">385,571</ix:nonFraction> shares on May 22, 2026. &#160;As of June&#160;30,&#160;2026, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_J-g7dEaKxk-gRn7X2bISag" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_wwr_InducementPlanMember_D9JriMuP4kucVixcVccYRQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_VwEiaQPwKEOgms-zM07UIQ">500,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock were available for future issuances under the Inducement Plan.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Fo